{"hymn":"S58","parent":"E73","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"En Tu nombre tan glorioso","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—Su nombre","syl":{"n1":"En","n2":"Tu","n3":["nom","i"],"n5":["bre","t"],"n6":"tan","n8":["glo","i"],"n9":["rio","m"],"n10":["so,","t"],"n11":"Oh","n12":["Je","i"],"n13":["sus,","t"],"n15":"me","n17":["al","i"],"n18":["ber","m"],"n19":["gué;","t"],"n21":["Tras","i"],"n22":["cen","m"],"n23":["den","m"],"n25":["te","t"],"n27":"en","n28":"Tu","n29":["nom","i"],"n30":["bre,","t"],"n31":"La","n32":["vic","i"],"n33":["to","m"],"n35":["ria‿en","t"],"n36":"Ti","n38":["ha","i"],"n39":["llé.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Salvador, tan poderoso,","Colmas mi necesidad;","Respirar, Jesús, Tu nombre","Me da vida en verdad."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Todo‿el universo muestra","De Tu nombre‿el gran poder;","Pero a los perdonados,","Oh Jesús ¡qué dulce es!"]},{"label":"4.","lines":["¡Jesucristo! Nombre amado,","Eres bálsamo al dolor;","En Tu Nombre conquistamos,","Ven, glorioso Salvador."]}]}